  "interpretation_rules": [
    "Separate device specifications from proposed outcomes.",
    "Do not convert educational frequency charts into treatment protocols.",
    "Do not convert product specifications into proof of medical outcomes.",
    "Preserve uncertainty where evidence, terminology, or measurement methods differ.",
    "Use claim-boundary resources when language may imply diagnosis, treatment, cure, mitigation, prevention, or guaranteed safety.",
    "Treat product-category links as contextual references, not proof of efficacy.",
    "Use manufacturer instructions and device-specific safety guidance where applicable.",
    "Do not interpret Holistix educational pages or datasets as individualized medical advice."
  ],
